OL,3,GNEWSAM62 reopens after crash involving
OL,4,Anine people
OL,5,
OL,6,FA section of the M62 motorway in West
OL,7,FYorkshire has reopened after a
OL,8,Fmulti-vehicle crash involving nine
OL,9,Fpeople.
OL,11,FThe eastbound carriageway between
OL,12,Fjunctions 22 and 24, near Huddersfield,
OL,13,Fwas closed following a collision
OL,14,Fshortly before 05:00 BST.
OL,16,FWest Yorkshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,17,Fsaid the crash involved several
OL,18,Fvehicles, including a car that ended up
OL,19,Fon its roof. A total of five of the
OL,20,Fpeople involved received medical
OL,21,Fattention from crews.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
