OL,3,GNEWSAM62 reopens after crash involving
OL,4,Anine people
OL,5,
OL,6,FNational Highways confirmed all three
OL,7,Flanes had reopened but warned drivers
OL,8,Fthat delays were continuing between
OL,9,Fjunctions 21 and 22.
